      {
        "id": 221931,
        "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-04T02:31:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was actually kind of astounded-- we got in a 4 player game last night and not only did we win…<em>no one died</em>.</p>\n<p>We played with Ra, Parse, Team Leader Tachyon, and Akash’Flora, all starting off in the Enclave of the Endlings and the Time Cataclysm.  We managed to complete Apex of Humanity and A Brother’s Sacrifice in the first turn, with a number of other readers soon to follow, including Devastating Aurora.</p>\n<p>Between Brothers Sacrifice and 3 hypersonic assaults, we didnt take damage for 4 straight rounds.  TLT picked up Lucky Strike and the Virtuoso spirits, while Ra picked up Cursor and the Bloodsworn Coliseum.</p>\n<p>By game end, we’d killed 6 Scions (including <em>that</em> guy), and Tachyon used a fully amped up Oblivaeon shard to pound the cosmic destroyer into submission.</p>\n<p>End tally? One dead Oblivaeon, 6 dead Scions, only one environment lost (Time Cataclysm), and no fatalities.</p>",
