        "raw": "I was actually kind of astounded-- we got in a 4 player game last night and not only did we win...*no one died*.\r\n\r\nWe played with Ra, Parse, Team Leader Tachyon, and Akash'Flora, all starting off in the Enclave of the Endlings and the Time Cataclysm.  We managed to complete Apex of Humanity and A Brother's Sacrifice in the first turn, with a number of other readers soon to follow, including Devastating Aurora.  \r\n\r\nBetween Brothers Sacrifice and 3 hypersonic assaults, we didnt take damage for 4 straight rounds.  TLT picked up Lucky Strike and the Virtuoso spirits, while Ra picked up Cursor and the Bloodsworn Coliseum.\r\n\r\nBy game end, we'd killed 6 Scions (including *that* guy), and Tachyon used a fully amped up Oblivaeon shard to pound the cosmic destroyer into submission.  \r\n\r\nEnd tally? One dead Oblivaeon, 6 dead Scions, only one environment lost (Time Cataclysm), and no fatalities.",
